{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "God Syndrome",
    "steam_appid": 3338050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark, cold room. Sturdy bars cover the windows, through which you can glimpse the silhouettes of dead trees bathed in cold moonlight. The dampness and age hang heavily in the air, and faint sounds heighten a sense of unease. Your head is splitting, your thoughts are chaotic, and your memories are shrouded in a thick fog. Gathering your willpower, you take your first steps into the darkness\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is how someone's twisted dream begins, how a macabre feast commences, how a path strewn with pain and death unfolds, where each step might be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this path, only you decide who will be your ally and who your enemy. Lie, manipulate, make deals, fight or surrender, kill or die \u2014 the choice is yours. Will you have the strength to reach the end? And how will this feast of bones conclude?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God Syndrome</strong> is an original project inspired by iconic franchises like <i>Saw</i>, <i>Danganronpa</i>, and <i>Your Turn To Die</i>. We've always dreamed of creating a game built around a high-stakes survival scenario \u2014 where every choice matters and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a story about deadly trials \u2014 it's a game about trust, betrayal, and the will to survive when all hope seems lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Psychological Horror Roguelike</strong>. The game combines elements of a visual novel and a quest, offering a dynamic, immersive story with visually striking scenes. Enjoy a storyline that comes alive before your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Explore</strong>. Move wherever you want, discover new locations, and immerse yourself in the environment. You\u2019re not just an observer but an active participant in this story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice in Problem Solving</strong>. Complete tasks in whatever way you see fit. The skill upgrade system allows you to tailor gameplay mechanics to suit your style. Don\u2019t want to waste time looking for keys? Grow stronger to break down doors, or find another way in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Social Interaction System</strong>. Develop your social skills and choose your own approach to interacting with other characters. Use diplomacy and kindness if that\u2019s your style, or achieve your goals through intimidation and strength. Want to manipulate others with lies? It\u2019s all up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Locations</strong>. Search for important items that will unlock new possibilities or protect you when you need it most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving</strong>. Solve puzzles to obtain unique items or save the most valuable thing you have \u2014 your life. Sometimes, a riddle\u2019s solution is the only way to survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictability</strong>. Be prepared for unexpected events that can completely change the rules of the game. Other people, traps, and puzzles are far from the greatest threats. There is something much more terrifying lurking in the darkness of this world\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Beginning of a Great Story</strong>. This is only the first chapter of your journey, an entry into a world filled with darkness, horrors, and mysteries. Ahead lies more trials, new enemies, and new opportunities. Will you be able to reach the end of this story?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark, cold room. Sturdy bars cover the windows, through which you can glimpse the silhouettes of dead trees bathed in cold moonlight. The dampness and age hang heavily in the air, and faint sounds heighten a sense of unease. Your head is splitting, your thoughts are chaotic, and your memories are shrouded in a thick fog. Gathering your willpower, you take your first steps into the darkness\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is how someone's twisted dream begins, how a macabre feast commences, how a path strewn with pain and death unfolds, where each step might be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this path, only you decide who will be your ally and who your enemy. Lie, manipulate, make deals, fight or surrender, kill or die \u2014 the choice is yours. Will you have the strength to reach the end? And how will this feast of bones conclude?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God Syndrome</strong> is an original project inspired by iconic franchises like <i>Saw</i>, <i>Danganronpa</i>, and <i>Your Turn To Die</i>. We've always dreamed of creating a game built around a high-stakes survival scenario \u2014 where every choice matters and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a story about deadly trials \u2014 it's a game about trust, betrayal, and the will to survive when all hope seems lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Psychological Horror Roguelike</strong>. The game combines elements of a visual novel and a quest, offering a dynamic, immersive story with visually striking scenes. Enjoy a storyline that comes alive before your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Explore</strong>. Move wherever you want, discover new locations, and immerse yourself in the environment. You\u2019re not just an observer but an active participant in this story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice in Problem Solving</strong>. Complete tasks in whatever way you see fit. The skill upgrade system allows you to tailor gameplay mechanics to suit your style. Don\u2019t want to waste time looking for keys? Grow stronger to break down doors, or find another way in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Social Interaction System</strong>. Develop your social skills and choose your own approach to interacting with other characters. Use diplomacy and kindness if that\u2019s your style, or achieve your goals through intimidation and strength. Want to manipulate others with lies? It\u2019s all up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Locations</strong>. Search for important items that will unlock new possibilities or protect you when you need it most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving</strong>. Solve puzzles to obtain unique items or save the most valuable thing you have \u2014 your life. Sometimes, a riddle\u2019s solution is the only way to survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictability</strong>. Be prepared for unexpected events that can completely change the rules of the game. Other people, traps, and puzzles are far from the greatest threats. There is something much more terrifying lurking in the darkness of this world\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Beginning of a Great Story</strong>. This is only the first chapter of your journey, an entry into a world filled with darkness, horrors, and mysteries. Ahead lies more trials, new enemies, and new opportunities. Will you be able to reach the end of this story?</p>",
    "short_description": "An atmospheric psychological horror-roguelike with elements of visual novel and quest. Explore a dark world, solve puzzles, make tough decisions, and build relationships with characters. Every choice can determine whether you survive.",
